      "title": "Rotational-symmetry restrictions and rct4 modeling",
      "summary": "This program records the complete arbitrary-center Euclidean-rotation classification for finite noncollinear lattice sets, its consequences for hypothetical 153- and 154-point no-three-in-line subsets of G_77, and the exact model for the stricter rct4 subclass. The rct4 satisfiability question remains unresolved, and the certified interval remains 152 ≤ D(77) ≤ 154.",
