    {
      "action": "update",
      "nodeId": "d77/154-half-turn-center",
      "parentId": "program/rotational-symmetry",
      "nodeType": "lemma",
      "title": "Rotational symmetry of a 154-point set",
      "summary": "If a 154-point no-three-in-line subset of G_77 has nontrivial rotational symmetry, that symmetry must be the half-turn about (38,38), and the center must be unselected. Every row and column then contains exactly two selected points. This conditional classification does not assert existence or exclude asymmetric or reflection-symmetric configurations.",
